{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13674","headline":"荅刘长卿蛇浦桥月下重送 · 严维","name":"荅刘长卿蛇浦桥月下重送","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月色今宵最明，庭闲夜久天清。\n寂寞多年老宦，殷懃远别深情。\n溪临修竹烟色，风落高梧雨声。\n耿耿相看不寐，遥闻晓柝山城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}